vendor/cgltf (tag v1.15). cgltf is licensed under the MIT License; its full text is
vendor/cgltf/LICENSE. cgltf embeds jsmn, by Serge Zaitsev, also MIT-licensed; that
notice is inside vendor/cgltf/cgltf.h.

